WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.047 --> 00:00:11.097
Ringo was working on Bot.

2
00:00:11.098 --> 00:00:15.218
"Let's play Space Pong!" Lucy said.

3
00:00:15.219 --> 00:00:19.794
Ringo shook his head. "I can't.

4
00:00:19.795 --> 00:00:21.839
Bot broke down again.

5
00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:23.834
I need to fix her."

6
00:00:23.835 --> 00:00:27.753
"You need a new robot," Lucy said.

7
00:00:27.754 --> 00:00:30.872
"Bot is old and clunky."

8
00:00:30.873 --> 00:00:34.160
"Bot is the best," Ringo said.

9
00:00:34.161 --> 00:00:37.287
"I can fix her!"

10
00:00:37.288 --> 00:00:41.453
Lucy went away.

11
00:00:41.454 --> 00:00:44.209
Ringo looked inside Bot.

12
00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:48.412
Her parts all looked fine.

13
00:00:48.413 --> 00:00:51.580
Bot's wires looked fine too.

14
00:00:51.581 --> 00:00:55.171
"Hmm," Ringo said.

15
00:00:55.172 --> 00:00:59.233
He shined a light inside Bot.

16
00:00:59.234 --> 00:01:01.794
Then he saw something.

17
00:01:01.795 --> 00:01:07.507
"Aha!" Ringo took out a rusty part.

18
00:01:07.508 --> 00:01:10.174
"Bot just needs a new hex link.

19
00:01:10.175 --> 00:01:20.619
I knew I could fix her!"

20
00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:23.271
Ringo went to the supply room.

21
00:01:23.272 --> 00:01:26.294
He asked a worker for a hex link.

22
00:01:26.295 --> 00:01:30.572
The worker laughed. "Why?

23
00:01:30.573 --> 00:01:34.127
New robots don't have hex links!"

24
00:01:34.128 --> 00:01:39.692
Ringo grinned. "My robot is old."

25
00:01:39.693 --> 00:01:43.391
The worker looked around the room.

26
00:01:43.392 --> 00:01:49.000
He didn't see any hex links.

27
00:01:49.001 --> 00:01:53.903
He looked them up on a computer.

28
00:01:53.904 --> 00:01:56.914
"Bad news," the worker said.

29
00:01:56.915 --> 00:01:59.902
"They stopped making hex links."

30
00:01:59.903 --> 00:02:08.898
Ringo gulped. "How will I fix Bot?"

